    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "gmnotes": "",
      "short": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>You release a howl of primal rage, echoing the pain of Dreamers awoken by injury. Creatures in the area that fail their saves are @UUID[Compendium.sfrpg.conditions.Item.nywSVEeDvp1bk7L3]{Shaken} for [[/r 2d4]] rounds. Dreamers are immune to this spell.</p>\n<p>Barathus can cast this spell as a reaction when reduced to 0 Hit Points. In this case, the spell’s DC is increased by 2.</p>"
